Changes made by All For One Tech (non-exhaustive, see git history for details):
  - Added an OpenAI-compatible multi-provider content generator
    (packages/core/src/core/afot*.ts) with OpenCode, NVIDIA, OpenRouter, Groq,
    DeepSeek, Cline and Kilo provider support.
  - Added ~/.afot credential/config storage, a session path guard, a plugin
    loader, a swarm orchestrator and related slash commands.
  - Disabled Google telemetry (Clearcut / GCP exporters) and update checks.
  - Rebranded the CLI as "AFOT CLI" (binary: afot).

